{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:56:06+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:56:06+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Bank of Ireland Group plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"Ireland","city":"Dublin","website":"https://www.bankofireland.com","employees":11030,"summary":"Bank of Ireland Group plc provides banking and other financial services in the Republic of Ireland, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It offers current and savings accounts, demand and notice accounts, and business accounts and deposits; personal, car, home improvement and energy upgrade, top-up loans, and student loans, as well as overdrafts and mortgages; and business and farming loans, green business, insurance premium finance, invoice finance, hire purchase, and leasing services. The company also provides international payments and credit cards; international money transfer services; investment products; premier and private banking services; and business protection, mortgage protection, income protection, home protection, and protection for individuals and families. In addition, it provides home, car, travel, and life insurance products. It offers its products and services through its bank branches, banking app, and online and phone banking channels. Bank of Ireland Group plc was founded in 1783 and is headquartered in Dublin, Ireland.","exchange":"Irish","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"Bank of Ireland Group plc fournit des services bancaires et autres services financiers en République d'Irlande, au Royaume-Uni et à l'international. Il offre des comptes courants et d'épargne, des comptes de demande et d'avis, et des comptes d'affaires et des dépôts; personnel, voiture, amélioration de l'habitat et mise à niveau de l'énergie, des prêts complémentaires et des prêts étudiants, ainsi que des découverts et des prêts hypothécaires; et des prêts aux entreprises et à l'agriculture, des entreprises vertes, le financement des primes d'assurance, le financement des factures, l'achat de location et des services de location. La société fournit également des paiements internationaux et des cartes de crédit, des services de transfert d'argent international, des produits d'investissement, des services bancaires de premier ordre et privés, ainsi que la protection des entreprises, la protection hypothécaire, la protection du revenu, la protection du domicile et la protection des personnes et des familles."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":17058870272,"shares_outstanding":943000000,"trailing_pe":13.4,"forward_pe":9.815731,"price_to_book":1.3104898,"ev_to_ebitda":null,"ev_to_revenue":1.883,"dividend_yield":0.0448,"payout_ratio":0.517,"beta_yahoo":0.432},"targets":{"current_price":18.09,"mean":21.07846,"median":21.9,"high":23.4,"low":16.0,"n_analysts":13,"reco_mean":1.84615,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-07-31"],"eps_avg":null,"eps_low":null,"eps_high":null,"revenue_avg":null,"ex_dividend":"2026-10-01","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.00062,"institutions_pct":0.65849,"institutions_float_pct":0.6589,"institutions_n":375,"institutions":[{"name":"Estabrook Capital Management","pct":0.0,"shares":66,"value":1193,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":4443,"value":80373,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"THORNBURG INVESTMENT TRUST-Thornburg Investment Income Builder Fund","pct":0.020599999,"shares":19129250,"value":346048135,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0150999995,"shares":14038342,"value":253953608,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":-0.0028},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST X-MFS International Intrinsic Value Fund","pct":0.0136,"shares":12666329,"value":229133893,"date":"2026-05-31","chg":-0.174},{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST I-MFS Research I